### 🍎 Phase 3: iOS App Deployment (Fast Track without App Store Delay)

#### 1. Deploy via Apple **TestFlight** (Recommended):
TestFlight allows you to distribute the app to up to **10,000 internal/external testers** without undergoing public App Store review.

1. Open the project in Xcode:
   ```bash
   cd /home/meoclavezz/Projects-1/Edge_AI_CCTV/mobile_app/ios
   open Runner.xcworkspace
   ```
2. Set your **Development Team** in **Signing & Capabilities**.
3. Select **Any iOS Device (arm64)** as the build target.
4. In the top menu, go to **Product > Archive**.
5. Once archived, click **Distribute App > App Store Connect > Upload**.
6. In [App Store Connect](https://appstoreconnect.apple.com), open your app > **TestFlight**, add your Apple ID as an Internal Tester, and install it via the **TestFlight app** on your iPhone.

#### 2. Direct Sideloading via Xcode (Immediate Cable Install):
1. Connect your iPhone to your Mac via USB.
2. In Xcode, select your connected iPhone from the device dropdown.
3. Click the **Run ▶** button. The app will install directly onto your iPhone with full debugging and push capabilities.

